<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 11.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 11.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Feb 11	Feb 10     Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  261.050     259.680     247.020    5.68 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  304.400     304.900     306.830   -0.79 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.365     157.045     158.970   -1.64 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.340	46.530	47.182   -1.78 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  427.500     424.320     419.180    1.98 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.290     139.840     141.685   -1.69 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.929	15.976	16.185   -1.58 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  211.800     211.820     212.430   -0.30 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.848	 1.856	 1.888   -2.12 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.555	 1.568	 1.581   -1.64 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  182.650     182.715     183.135   -0.26 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
